@startuml 01_cliente_servidor_serial
title Arquitetura 1: Cliente-Servidor Serial (1 download por vez)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<server>> #FFD966
  BackgroundColor<<client>> #9FC5E8
  BorderColor black
}

rectangle "SERVIDOR\n(fila única,\n1 conexão ativa)" as S <<server>>

rectangle "Cliente 1\n(download ativo)" as C1 <<client>>
rectangle "Cliente 2\n(aguardando)" as C2 <<client>>
rectangle "Cliente 3\n(aguardando)" as C3 <<client>>

S -down-> C1 : envia arquivo\n(t = 0s a 10s)
C2 .down.> S : na fila
C3 .down.> S : na fila

note bottom of S
  Atende 1 por vez.
  Tempo total = N clientes × tempo individual
end note

@enduml
